1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:02,041
The Governor has arrived!

2
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:05,583
- Governor!
- Governor!

3
00:00:11,958 --> 00:00:14,750
My lord, what brings you here?

4
00:00:15,375 --> 00:00:16,833
What are you doing here?

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,583
Someone is impersonating the Godfather.

6
00:00:20,791 --> 00:00:21,291
What?!

7
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,916
Someone dares impersonate the Godfather?

8
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:25,875
Arrest him immediately!

9
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:26,750
Yes!

10
00:00:31,041 --> 00:00:31,833
Wait!

11
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:37,875
Which one is
Mr. Carter?

12
00:00:39,291 --> 00:00:41,666
Governor, there are several Carters here.

13
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:43,291
Which one do you mean?

14
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:47,083
The groom holding the wedding here today.

15
00:00:47,583 --> 00:00:48,625
That would be me.

16
00:00:50,541 --> 00:00:53,333
This is my wedding with Lady Livia.

17
00:00:56,541 --> 00:01:00,083
The Governor of Emeraldstone greets Mr. Carter.

18
00:01:01,375 --> 00:01:03,125
Please accept it,
Mr. Carter.

19
00:01:12,666 --> 00:01:13,541
Thank you, Governor.

20
00:01:13,958 --> 00:01:14,875
You’re too kind.

21
00:01:16,958 --> 00:01:17,833
It’s only proper.

22
00:01:25,125 --> 00:01:25,791
See that?

23
00:01:27,208 --> 00:01:28,708
Even the Governor came personally to my wedding.

24
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:30,541
What do you have to compete with me?

25
00:01:30,916 --> 00:01:33,541
Darling, now do you see I was the right choice?

26
00:01:35,583 --> 00:01:37,666
I never doubted my choice for a second.

27
00:01:38,416 --> 00:01:39,916
Stop looking at me like that.

28
00:01:40,583 --> 00:01:41,750
You might regret it.

29
00:01:42,166 --> 00:01:42,541
Hah… 

30
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:44,833
you should worry about yourself.

31
00:01:45,791 --> 00:01:47,250
Impersonating the Godfather?

32
00:01:48,666 --> 00:01:50,333
You’re going to hang for that.

33
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:54,166
It isn’t a crime that ends with mere death.

34
00:01:54,958 --> 00:01:56,166
Do you think I’m a fake?

35
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,416
This man is also a
Mr. Carter?

36
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:03,666
Governor, that’s my worthless older brother,

37
00:02:04,083 --> 00:02:06,125
a disowned son of House Carter,

38
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,583
nothing but a miner.

39
00:02:08,083 --> 00:02:09,750
Then he truly is worthless.

40
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:10,208
Los!

41
00:02:11,291 --> 00:02:13,083
How can you be so blind that

42
00:02:13,083 --> 00:02:14,791
you fail to recognize the Godfather?

43
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,541
What?!

44
00:02:16,333 --> 00:02:19,333
You’re saying I failed to recognize the Godfather?

45
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,583
This is the man you should be congratulating.

46
00:02:23,125 --> 00:02:25,875
 Lord Severin, the Godfather of the Sovereign Sanctum.
